{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30350","headline":"早发剡中石城寺 · 赵嘏","name":"早发剡中石城寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"暂息劳生树色间，平明机虑又相关。\n吟辞宿处烟霞去，心负秋来水石闲。\n竹户半开钟未绝，松枝静霁鹤初还。\n明朝一倍堪惆怅，回首尘中见此山。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵嘏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30350.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30350","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}